.70 at the end of 2011 to a range of PEN2.62 to PEN2.67 in 2012," Banco de Credito said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market will be closed on Friday.\par \par \uc2 -By Ryan Dube, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-945 043 802; peru@dowjones.com [ 22-12-11 2130GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020111222e7cm000x3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
