\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Lower; Sol Strengthens A Bit\b0\par\par\uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 November 2011\par 22:18\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global FX & Fixed Income News\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock market indexes ended weaker Friday, as blue-chip shares continued to shed strength. The Lima Stock Exchange's broad General Index closed 0.33% lower at 19240.14, while the blue-chip Selective Index ended 0.22% weaker at 26915.52.\par \par \uc2 Precious-metals miner \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA (BVN, BUENAVC1.Vl) weakened 2.59% to end at $39.45. Financial holding company \uc2 Credicorp Ltd\uc2 . (BAP) lost 0.48% to end at $101.00. Silver and lead miner \uc2 Volcan Compania Minera\uc2  SAA (VOLCABC1.VL) declined 1.0% to end at 2.97 soles. ($1.10)\par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday to buy $115 million at an average of PEN2.700 per U.S. dollar. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out volatility in the exchange market.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the sol closed slightly stronger at PEN2.701 per dollar, compared with PEN2.702 per dollar in the previous trading session.\par \par \uc2 So far this year, the sol has appreciated 3.78% against the greenback.\par \par \uc2 Peru's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is expected to be volatile in the short term due to the financial crisis affecting various nations, especially in Europe, Banco de Credito said in a report.\par \par \uc2 "Going forward, we expect volatile movements in the exchange rate in the short term due to the evolution of the external crisis and the next measures taken by European government," it said.\par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-99927 7269; peru@dowjones.com [ 11-18-11 1618ET ]\par \par \uc2 1071 1837 27   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020111118e7bi0005i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
