\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Lower; Sol Strengthens\b0\par\par\uc2 258 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 September 2011\par 22:59\par \uc2 Dow Jones News Service\par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock market indexes ended lower Thursday following international markets that declined as a speech by U.S. Federal Reserve Chairman Ben Bernanke failed to ease investor uncertainty in the U.S. economy.\par \par \uc2 The broad General Index closed 0.28% weaker at 20077.53.\par \par \uc2 The blue-chip Selective Index ended 0.24% lower at 28159.26.\par \par \uc2 Financial-holding company \uc2 Credicorp Ltd\uc2 . (BAP) declined 1.08% to end at $100.30. The company owns Peru's largest bank, Banco de Credito.\par \par \uc2 Copper-mining company Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA (CVERDEC1.VL) was off 0.38% at close at $39.15. Cerro Verde's mine was halted for the second day Thursday as part of a 48-hour strike by unionized workers seeking higher pay.\par \par \uc2 Base-metals mining company \uc2 Southern Copper Corp\uc2 . (SCCO) fell 2.08% to end at $32.00.\par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Thursday to purchase $195 million at an average of PEN2.724 per U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday to purchase $110 million. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out volatility in the exchange market.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the sol closed slightly stronger Thursday at PEN2.725 per dollar, compared with PEN2.726 per dollar in the previous session.\par \par \uc2 So far this year, the sol has appreciated 2.92% against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 -By Ryan Dube, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-945-043-802; peru@dowjones.com [ 09-08-11 1659ET ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJ00000020110908e798000vz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
