\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Sharply Higher; Sol Unchanged\b0\par\par\uc2 225 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Juli 2011\par 22:25\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global FX & Fixed Income News\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock market indexes ended higher Tuesday, on continued optimism after President-elect Ollanta Humala announced Sunday that he will reappointment Central Reserve Bank of Peru President Julio Velarde as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief.\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, the broad General Index closed 3.00% higher at 21,923.27. The blue-chip Selective Index ended 5.16% stronger at 29,430.79.\par \par \uc2 Humala, a former military officer, will take office on July 28.\par \par \uc2 Financial holding \uc2 Credicorp Ltd\uc2 , (BAP) which owns Peru's largest bank, gained 3.02% to end at $94.26.\par \par \uc2 Copper miner \uc2 Southern Copper Corp\uc2 . (SCCO) ended 0.78% higher at $36.28. Precious metals miner \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA (BVN, BUENAVC1.Vl) ended 0.97% higher at $41.70.\par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Tuesday to purchase $194 million at an average of PEN2.7373 per U.S. dollar.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out volatility in the exchange market. On Monday it purchased $57 million.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the sol closed Tuesday unchanged at PEN2.7390 per dollar. The sol has gained 2.42% so far this year against the greenback.\par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-99927 7269; peru@dowjones.com [ 07-19-11 1625ET ]\par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020110719e77j00054\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2