e impact of higher prices for consumers. On Feb. 10, the day after its most recent interest rate decision, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $130 million to knock the sol back from a 33-month high.\par \par \uc2 PERU-ECONOMY/RATES (PREVIEW)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110311e738001gm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
